@startuml BusinessLogicLayerPackages

title Financial Position Report Generator - Business Logic Layer Packages
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "asset_report.business" as Business #E2F3E7 {
  [__init__.py] as BusinessAPI
  [analysis.py] as AnalysisModule
  BusinessAPI ..> AnalysisModule : re-exports
}

package "asset_report.domain" as Domain #E3F0F8 {
  [models.py] as ModelsModule
}

AnalysisModule ..> ModelsModule : asset/liability items + FinancialStatementData + Money

note bottom of Business
  analysis.py contains MetricsCalculator,
  FinancialMetric, FinancialAnalysisResult, and
  TimeFrameAnalysisResult plus FinancialAnalysisService.

  Paired class diagram:
  03_business_logic_layer_classes.puml
end note

@enduml
